    "text": "2urbangirls.com\nwebsite\nInglewood\n2 sentenced to life in prison in connection with deadly shooting spree in Compton, Inglewood\n14 hours ago\nINGLEWOOD – Two men were sentenced on Tuesday, Aug. 5, to five consecutive life prison terms without the possibility of parole for a gang-related shooting spree that included the killings of four people at a birthday party in Inglewood, along with the slayings of three other people in South Los Angeles and the Compton area within less than two months.\n20",
